{"seq":27,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"1bd18d7a-fed4-4e61-945d-b3cadf583bc5","runId":"run_1_1788552073503","result":"Done! The regex has been saved to `/app/regex.txt`.\n\nHere's how it works:\n\n**IPv4 Validation**: Each octet allows 0-255 without leading zeros:\n- `0` (single zero)\n- `1-9` (single digit)\n- `10-99` (two digits)\n- `100-199`, `200-249`, `250-255` (three digits with proper ranges)\n\n**Date Validation**: Month-specific day ranges:\n- Months 01,03,05,07,08,10,12: days 01-31\n- Months 04,06,09,11: days 01-30  \n- Month 02: days 01-29\n\n**Last Date Matching**:\n- `(?=.*IPv4)` ensures the line contains an IPv4\n- `.*?` matches non-greedily to find the date\n- Captured date has word boundaries (`\\b`) to exclude false matches\n- `(?!.*date_pattern)` negative lookahead ensures no more dates follow on the line\n\nThe regex respects MULTILINE mode where `.` stays within single lines, so the search doesn't cross line boundaries.","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":89796,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"1bd18d7a-fed4-4e61-945d-b3cadf583bc5","total_cost_usd":0.08714335,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13605,"cache_read_input_tokens":26321,"output_tokens":13249,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":12487},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":13605},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":662,"cache_read_input_tokens":13632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12662,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":12662,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1158,"outputTokens":17,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001243,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5